<h2>SobekCM Instances</h2>

<p>We suspect there are many more instances, but no registration is necessary for installing and running a SobekCM instance.  Below are the 
known instances:</p>

<ul>
<li><a href="http://ufdc.ufl.edu">University of Florida Digital Collections</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www.dloc.com">Digital Library of the Caribbean</a></li>
<li><a href="http://digital.wolfsonian.org/">Wolfsonian Digital Images Collection</a></li>
<li>Florida International University ( dPanther )</li>
<li>Shoah Foundation</li>
<li>University of London, School of Oriental and Asian Studies</li>
<li><a href="http://ncf.sobek.ufl.edu">New College of Florida</a></li>
<li>University of the Netherland Antilles</li>
<li>University of South Florida</li>
<li><a href="http://fiu.sobek.ufl.edu">Guantanamo Bay Collection</a> for FIU class</li>
<li><a href="http://gulfcoast.sobek.ufl.edu">Gulf Coast College</a></li>
		<li>Seminole State College</li>
		<li>Lake-Sumter State College</li>


</ul>


